# Copy to .env.local for a build that talks to a deployed backend.
#
# This is baked into the bundle at build time (`vite build`), so it must be set
# in the environment of the build that produces the deployed site - editing it
# afterwards changes nothing until you rebuild.
#
# Use the API's origin only; `/api` is appended by the app. Leave it unset to
# call the same origin the site is served from (what `npm run dev` proxies).
# VITE_API_URL=https://imizi-api.onrender.com

# --- Auth0 (optional) ---
# All three are required to enable the "Continue with Auth0" buttons;
# leave them unset and the button is simply not rendered.
# VITE_AUTH0_DOMAIN=imizi.eu.auth0.com
# VITE_AUTH0_CLIENT_ID=your_spa_client_id
# VITE_AUTH0_AUDIENCE=https://api.imizi.rw
#
# VITE_AUTH0_DOMAIN is the tenant domain without https://. VITE_AUTH0_AUDIENCE
# is the API Identifier registered in Auth0 and must match the backend's
# AUTH0_API_AUDIENCE. In the Auth0 application, register the callback as
# <site origin>/callback and the site origin as an allowed logout URL.
